# Samvad HealthDesk AI — Frontend Environment Configuration
# When both variables are supplied with valid http(s) URLs and keys, the frontend runs in
# live Supabase mode against Auth, Edge Functions, PostgreSQL, RLS, and RPCs.
# If either variable is empty, the app automatically runs in typed mock mode.

# Supabase Project URL (e.g. http://127.0.0.1:54321 for local dev or https://<project-ref>.supabase.co for production)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase Client Public Key (Anon Key or Publishable Key only).
# NEVER expose or place the secret/service_role key in frontend configuration!
VITE_SUPABASE_KEY=


